## Context
functional requirement:
[OUTPUT] ## general overview of the project Develop a web application named 'Sports Equipment Inventory Tracker' that helps sports teams and organizations efficiently manage their equipment inventory. The application allows users to track, update, and organize various types of sports equipment. ## software functional requirements 1. **User Registration**    - Users shall be able to register for an account on the Registration Page by entering a username and password. 2. **User Login**    - Users shall be able to log in to their account on the Login Page by entering a username and password. 3. **Equipment Management**    - Users shall be able to input and update information about different types of equipment, such as jerseys, balls, and training gear, on the Dashboard Page. 4. **Equipment Information Display**    - Users shall be able to view the quantity, condition, availability, and location of each equipment item. 5. **Maintenance Alerts**    - Users shall be able to set alerts for maintenance or replacement of equipment items. 6. **Equipment Search**    - Users shall be able to search for specific equipment by name, type, or location. 7. **Equipment Filtering**    - Users shall be able to filter the equipment list based on different criteria, such as condition or availability. 8. **User Logout**    - Users shall be able to log out of their account, returning to the Login Page. [/OUTPUT]

